                    "text": "Star Date: 5342.21",
                    "fontFamily": "system-ui",
                    "fontSize": "24px"
                },
                {
                    "type": "Image",
                    "id": "b4d027a8-494f-4b37-85cd-358a2616a96c",
                    "label": "planetP",
                    "texture": {
                        "key": "PlanetP"
                    },
                    "x": 323,
                    "y": 1160
                },
                {
                    "type": "Text",
                    "id": "777bdd62-1369-4684-9ff3-3a1b7d630ada",
                    "label": "text_1",
                    "x": 36,
                    "y": 1281,
                    "text": "Planet P is no more!\n\nThe long awaited astroid Helana impacted with the planet destroying all life.\n\nKnowing that this impact would happen well in advance, everyone was safely evacuated months ago.  However the economic impact is wide spread as Planet P was a major source of multiple resources needed throughout the empire.",
                    "fontFamily": "system-ui",
                    "fontSize": "24px",
                    "wordWrapWidth": 600
                },
