                    "label": "text_2",
                    "x": 26,
                    "y": 1984,
                    "text": "The war on planet Netera has escalated dramatically with the annihilation of the rebel stronghold of Lophion.\n\nAs quoted by one millitary leader \"This operation will server multiple purposes",
